    "identifier": "ranton-storm-release-reverse-beheading",
    "description": "<p>While covered in lightning, you spin, generating enough momentum to strike at everything around you. All creatures in range must make a Dexterity saving throw, taking your [Unarmed Damage] or [Weapon Damage] + 4d12 lightning damage on a failure or half as much on a success.</p>\n<p>If a creature fails their saving throw by 5 or more, they treat the damage they take as if they are vulnerable to it.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above B-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d12.</p>",
